WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.133
A good summary includes the central point and essential events without copying every

00:00:05.133 --> 00:00:05.512
detail.

00:00:06.367 --> 00:00:11.231
What belongs in an effective summary? Answer: The main idea and essential points.

00:00:12.033 --> 00:00:16.108
Give an oral summary, then write a three-sentence summary in your own words.

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:19.979
Discuss why: Summaries are concise and selective.
